{"type":"json_object","message":"The increase in unrecognized tax benefits from 2007 to 2008 is the difference between the ending balance at December 27, 2008 ($214.4 million) and the ending balance at December 29, 2007 ($126.6 million). Both values are from the reconciliation table (t8c1 and t8c2). Units are millions of dollars.","tool":"calculate","arguments":{"expression":"214.4 - 126.6","variables":{"a":{"value":214.4,"source":"source:t8c1n0","unit":"millions of dollars"},"b":{"value":126.6,"source":"source:t8c2n0","unit":"millions of dollars"}},"sources":{"a":"source:t8c1n0","b":"source:t8c2n0"}}}